    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3723\"><em data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3723\">(10th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"3725\" data-end=\"3748\"><em data-start=\"3725\" data-end=\"3748\">“Lore has weight.”</em></p><p data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3868\">When a creature knowingly violates a relevant Precedent, you may allow the accumulated weight of record to press down.</p><p data-start=\"3870\" data-end=\"3895\">Effects (GM adjudicated):</p><ul data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"4004\"><li data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"3919\"><p data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3919\">Impose roll 3d10 keep lowest 2</p></li><li data-start=\"3920\" data-end=\"3948\"><p data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"3948\">Apply psychic hesitation</p></li><li data-start=\"3949\" data-end=\"3976\"><p data-start=\"3951\" data-end=\"3976\">Levy a minor action tax</p></li><li data-start=\"3977\" data-end=\"4004\"><p data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4004\">Increase narrative risk</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"4006\" data-end=\"4075\">You are not attacking them.<br data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4036\" />You are letting the past assert itself.</p><h3 data-start=\"4077\" data-end=\"4085\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"4086\" data-end=\"4151\">Free reaction when applicable (unless layered with Civic Charge).</p><h3 data-start=\"4153\" data-end=\"4165\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4278\">If you punish deviation too often, <strong data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4227\">exceptions proliferate</strong>. High Administrative Pressure makes canon brittle.</p><p data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4317\"></p>",
